&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" bgcolor="#F0F0F0" style="background:#F0F0F0;padding:9px 28px 6px;"&gt;
&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class="meta ipr-d" style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#003A7E;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;"&gt;R. del S. 634&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="meta meta-date" align="right" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 3px 12px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1B4D;"&gt;Filed October 27, 2026 · first sent October 28, 2026&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" style="padding:22px 28px 24px;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Senate to investigate seawater and brackish-water desalination as a supplemental water source&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;Why it matters:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;The study would examine investment mechanisms and private-investor participation in desalination infrastructure. It also allows the Senate committee to request information from the Department of Economic Development and Commerce (DDEC) through its Energy Public Policy Program.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;What's new:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;font-weight:600;"&gt;First reading in the Senate (Oct 29) → referred to committee (Oct 29).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:0;"&gt;&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:50%;background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/medidas/162761" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1A1B4D;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;View on SUTRA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#1A1B4D" style="width:50%;background:#1A1B4D;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/SutraFilesGen/162761/rs0634-26.pdf" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;Read the bill (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
