&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" bgcolor="#F0F0F0" style="background:#F0F0F0;padding:9px 28px 6px;"&gt;
&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class="meta ipr-d" style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#003A7E;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;"&gt;P. del S. 1608&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="meta meta-date" align="right" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 3px 12px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1B4D;"&gt;Filed October 27, 2026 · first sent October 29, 2026&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" style="padding:22px 28px 24px;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Creates an integrated system and rights charter for preventing and addressing homelessness, led by the Housing Department&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;Why it matters:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Incidental keyword match: the Department of Economic Development and Commerce (DDEC) is only listed as an agency the new homelessness council may invite, without a vote. The measure itself concerns housing and social services, not investment or incentives.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;What's new:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;font-weight:600;"&gt;First reading in the Senate (Oct 29) → referred to committee (Oct 29).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
